url: "https://e7-g-t.vercel.app/"
abstract: >-
  E7G-T is a geometry-first modelling language and practical calculus
  for making construction, projection, preservation, loss,
  reconstruction, operational sameness, material boundaries,
  temporal extension, histories, transition paths, bridge mode,
  and admissible use visible. Version 0.12 preserves the v0.11-UC5
  constitutional kernel and adds optional executable profiles for exact
  formal combinations, symbolic families and explicit family-state composition,
  together with bounded Python reference models and internal validation records.
